ith the survivors, rebuild the fallen Greymanes, and reclaim what was lost. But on a journey where alliances are forged, dangers abound, and mysterious factions are uncovered, Kliff will come to realize that an unprecedented threat and a destiny greater than he imagined await him.\u200b", "summary": "Crimson Desert is an open-world action-adventure game set in the beautiful yet brutal continent of Pywel. Embark on a journey as the Greymane Kliff and restore what has been lost. Explore uncharted lands, fight against threats that stand in your way, and discover the wonders the world has in store.\n\nA plentiful adventure with the Deluxe Pack!\nEnjoy a diverse adventure with more armor, horse tack, and cosmetics for Kliff!\n\n[Deluxe Pack]\n\u25cf Kairos Plate Helm\n\u25cf Kairos Plate Gloves\n\u25cf Kairos Plate Boots\n\u25cf Kairos Cloak\n\u25cf Kairos Plate Armor\n\u25cf Balgran Shield\n\u25cf Exclaire Champron\n\u25cf Exclaire Barding\n\u25cf Exclaire Saddle\n\u25cf Exclaire Stirrups", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/crimson-desert-deluxe-edition", "videos": [{"id": 179869, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "RqA5Du0v5lM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RqA5Du0v5lM", "title": "Crimson Desert - Official Reveal Trailer | Pearl Abyss Connect 2019", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/RqA5Du0v5lM/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 179870, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "tYQRBqqpV3M", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tYQRBqqpV3M", "title": "Crimson Desert - World Premiere Gameplay Trailer | The Game Awards 2020", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/tYQRBqqpV3M/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 179871, "name": "Dev Diary", "video_id": "GxiHTuzZ6_w", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GxiHTuzZ6_w", "title": "Dev Archives: Game Overview | Crimson Desert", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/GxiHTuzZ6_w/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 179872, "name": "Ga